054797#post1054797\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So many things to reply to... lol<br /> <br /> First, to be on-topic, yeah, the books are pretty nice. I kinda don't want to run Forsaken because my book is nice and pristine and I don't want to mess it up. I ran a lot of Forsaken in the Cam, and my book got...well-loved, let's say. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Second, apparently I need to move to Seattle, what with all the folks around there.<br /> <br /> Third...<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> I live in the Harrisburg area, and while I've never heard it associated with Philly or Pittsburgh, that wouldn't surprise me. Pretty sure some folks think Philly is the state capital.<br /> <br /> And fourth...<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> While I'm entirely biased, having served as EC ARST Forsaken twice, AMST Forsaken twice, and AAMST Forsaken at least once (if not twice...wow, sensing a theme here), I have to high-five the praise for Forsaken. It was a good community by-and-large, I thought. I don't recall having to nuke a venue, though....</div> </div> </div> </div>1) I was born and raised in Philly and nearly everybody I spoke to Out of State thought Philly was the State Capital. Most folks I know in WA think it, too. ...some who think they're smart think it's Pittsburgh, haha.<br /> <br /> 2) the one LARP I ever found amazing and fun coincidentally was a Forsaken LARP, so go figure.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12981-romulusgloriosus","name":"RomulusGloriosus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12981_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"342"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-26T05:24:26-08:00","id":1055182,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RomulusGloriosus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1052082-i-finally-got-hardcopy-of-vampire-the-requiem-2e-also-cofd-core?p=1055085#post1055085\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> 1) I was born and raised in Philly and nearly everybody I spoke to Out of State thought Philly was the State Capital. Most folks I know in WA think it, too. ...some who think they're smart think it's Pittsburgh, haha.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, I mean, c'mon, one of those probably should be. Harrisburg's nothing to look at. I vote for Pittsburgh, because I like it better than Philly, but that's besides the point.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> 2) the one LARP I ever found amazing and fun coincidentally was a Forsaken LARP, so go figure. </div> </div> </div>It surprises some people how fun a Forsaken LARP is. At Grand Masquerade 2011, a buddy of mine and I were chatting with someone from OWbN and she found out we had run Forsaken. She was amazed that you could LARP it...which I found surprising, since folks have been playing Apocalypse in LARP form for years, but... *shrugs*<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>This space for rent.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/552-strider1276","name":"strider1276","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar552_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"382"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}